<Defs>

	<ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
		<defName>ShelterResidents</defName>
        <label>Final Protocol</label>
        <description>Your helicopter is shot down; you eject moments before it explodes. Amid the wreckage, you see the crimson glow of inbound missiles on the horizon—soon, everything will be annihilated. Your only hope is to reach an ancient pre-war bunker whose defenses might withstand the blast. Survive. Then see what's left of the world.</description>
		<scenario>
			<summary>Three crashlanded survivors - with nuclear fallout.</summary>
			<playerFaction>
				<def>PlayerFaction</def>
